Package: AdaptiveMCMCWorkflow
Type: Package
Title: Educational Adaptive Markov Chain Monte Carlo Algorithms
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Gabriel", "Alwan", email = "gtalwan@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Teaching-oriented implementations of basic Metropolis,
    Adaptive Metropolis, Robust Adaptive Metropolis, and Delayed Rejection
    Adaptive Metropolis. The computational kernels are written in C++ with
    RcppArmadillo, while targets, summaries, plots, diagnostics, and examples
    are implemented in R to keep each algorithm readable and easy to study.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    Rcpp
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
URL: https://github.com/gtalwan/AdaptiveMCMCworkflow
BugReports: https://github.com/gtalwan/AdaptiveMCMCworkflow/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
